{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yuki</strong> is a narrative horror adventure set in a remote, abandoned school where memories linger longer than the living. <br><br><strong>A story shaped by memory, regret, and choice</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words matter. Every conversation and discovery changes how the story unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three possible endings \u2014 each one reflecting your values and decisions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the past in fast-paced combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront lingering spirits in bullet hell encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast breakbeats and frenetic rhythms set the pace for intense battles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the mystery</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remains of a closed campus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the truth through an online chatroom, strange sightings, and whispered regrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only demons here are the memories we carry \u2014 and the ones we leave behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/693ddb2a171ed27b8de4ce080d4ff33a.poster.avif?t=1761370791\" width=680 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/693ddb2a171ed27b8de4ce080d4ff33a.webm?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/693ddb2a171ed27b8de4ce080d4ff33a.mp4?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>An online chatroom</strong> filled with rumors.<br>Mysterious sightings no one can explain.<br>A campus abandoned, its classrooms frozen in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And at the heart of it all \u2014 your best friend, missing without a trace.<br>What happened that night before the school closed down?<br>What secrets are still buried in its halls?<br>Move freely through a fully 3D-modeled environment. Interact with characters, examine objects, and solve puzzles to gather clues \u2014 each step bringing you closer to the truth.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/1f3ea52b78fa12b5fb7459900171fda3.poster.avif?t=1761370791\" width=680 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/1f3ea52b78fa12b5fb7459900171fda3.webm?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/1f3ea52b78fa12b5fb7459900171fda3.mp4?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The only demons here are not monsters of flesh and blood, but the <strong>echoes of regret</strong> left behind.<br>They linger in empty classrooms, drift through silent hallways, and whisper from forgotten corners of the school long after its doors were shut.<br>Each spirit you encounter is bound by unfinished stories, memories that refuse to fade, and choices that can no longer be undone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To move forward, you\u2019ll have to face not just their regrets \u2014 but your own.\u00a0<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/095415ec5ed4cce7ff2ad9404bd60b74.poster.avif?t=1761370791\" width=680 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/095415ec5ed4cce7ff2ad9404bd60b74.webm?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/095415ec5ed4cce7ff2ad9404bd60b74.mp4?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Words matter.</strong> But words alone won\u2019t save you. Confront the lingering spirits, face their relentless attacks in fast-paced bullet hell encounters, and adapt to each situation under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The knowledge you\u2019ve gathered from exploring the campus isn\u2019t just for solving puzzles \u2014 it\u2019s your weapon. Piece together what you\u2019ve learned, choose your words wisely, and turn memory itself into your advantage.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/513abae1379b5f08e206a6fdfbac4220.poster.avif?t=1761370791\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/513abae1379b5f08e206a6fdfbac4220.webm?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/513abae1379b5f08e206a6fdfbac4220.mp4?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Brighter Summer Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909220/eb31b63aa16a51a47900f0c151db6f654295e464.jpg"},{"name":"Garden Of Words","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909220/e121c438d9a9660ec230c05d7773668b77e0be7e.jpg"},{"name":"Sleepless Beauty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3909220/48a652e3532cf7adbdb1f62e09185968351d0949.jpg"},{"name":"Sensei!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcom