sible endings \u2014 each one reflecting your values and decisions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the past in fast-paced combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront lingering spirits in bullet hell encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast breakbeats and frenetic rhythms set the pace for intense battles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the mystery</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remains of a closed campus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the truth through an online chatroom, strange sightings, and whispered regrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only demons here are the memories we carry \u2014 and the ones we leave behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/693ddb2a171ed27b8de4ce080d4ff33a.poster.avif?t=1761370791\" width=680 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/693ddb2a171ed27b8de4ce080d4ff33a.webm?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/693ddb2a171ed27b8de4ce080d4ff33a.mp4?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>An online chatroom</strong> filled with rumors.<br>Mysterious sightings no one can explain.<br>A campus abandoned, its classrooms frozen in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And at the heart of it all \u2014 your best friend, missing without a trace.<br>What happened that night before the school closed down?<br>What secrets are still buried in its halls?<br>Move freely through a fully 3D-modeled environment. Interact with characters, examine objects, and solve puzzles to gather clues \u2014 each st